DESCRIPTION:Global Exchanges information and enrollment sessions will be held in the Fall 2026 semester.\n\nAll students interested in an exchange are required to start with this step to learn the basics\, such as how to select a program and academic courses\, financial aid & scholarships and timelines.\n\nFall 2026 Schedule:\n\n12:00 p.m. on Tuesdays in Room 2300 at The Globe (GME Building)1 p.m. on Fridays in Room 2300 at The GlobeZoom sessions will also be available during the Fall semester and announced on the FSU Global Exchanges website.If neither time works for you email [contact removed] and suggest some available dates and times. We look forward to meeting with you!
