DESCRIPTION:Join the Center for Global Engagement and a campus co-host every week for International Coffee Hour (ICH)! ICH occurs almost every Friday class is in session from 5 - 6:30pm in the Globe Dining Room. Each week will feature a snack\, coffee service\, and a campus student organization or resource as the co-host. ICH is a great place to socialize and make new friends!  This event is free and open to all FSU students\, faculty and staff.\n\nFollow @fsucge for the weekly ICH snack/co-host announcements.
GEO:30.440771;-84.298448
LOCATION:Global and Multicultural Engagement Building (GME)\, Dining Room
SUMMARY:International Coffee Hour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/international-coffee-hour-3876
CATEGORIES:International & Multicultural
END:VEVENT
