DESCRIPTION:Stand out in today’s interconnected world! Join us for a recurring information and enrollment session to learn how FSU’s Global Citizenship Certificate (GCC) can help you build global competencies\, enhance your resume\, and prepare for a global workforce.\n\nDuring this session\, we will cover program requirements—including global coursework\, campus events\, and a sustained international or domestic experience—as well as step-by-step instructions on how to enroll.\n\nMondays: 3:00 PM\n\nWednesdays: 4:30 PM\n\nLocation: GCC Lounge (First Floor\, The Globe)\n \n\nAlready Enrolled in the GCC? If you are a current student looking for program advising\, appointments can be scheduled by emailing [contact removed].\n\nTo explore program requirements and benefits ahead of time\, visit the FSU Global Citizenship Certificate Website.
GEO:30.440771;-84.298448
LOCATION:Global and Multicultural Engagement Building (GME)\, GCC Lounge (First Floor)
SUMMARY:Global Citizenship Certificate Fall 2026 Info Sessions 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/copy-of-global-citizenship-certificate-fall-2026-info-sessions
END:VEVENT
