DESCRIPTION:Join the Center for Global Engagement and the Congress of Graduate Students (COGS) for an afternoon of socializing and networking with your peers in a space specifically for graduate students. This event occurs during International Coffee Hour on September 18th and October 23rd from 5 - 6:30pm in the Globe Auditorium. Here\, graduate students will have access to the coffee hour snack of the week as well as a spread of additional food and beverages. This event is free and open to all FSU graduate students\, faculty and staff.
