DESCRIPTION:Interested in a Global Exchange program? Come to the annual Global Exchanges Fair for an opportunity to meet international exchange students from FSU partner universities and connect with FSU students who have recently returned from their own exchange experiences abroad. Learn about the experiences\, campuses and opportunities that can help you take your education international with FSU Global Exchanges.\n\nThe Global Exchange Fair will take place on Friday\, November 6th\, from 3:30-5PM in the Globe Auditorium (GME Building).
